msgstr ""
"\n"
"Inde - E-waybill via IRN\n"
"====================================\n"
"Ce module permet de générer un E-waybill via IRN..\n"

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_in_edi_gstr
msgid ""
"\n"
"Indian - GSTR with E-invoice\n"
